WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:36.550
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:36.820 --> 01:38.910
[The Lament of Autumn]

3
01:39.270 --> 01:41.800
[Episode 2]

4
01:58.200 --> 01:58.700
Okay,

5
01:59.420 --> 02:00.420
I'll bet with you.

6
02:02.350 --> 02:03.480
If you win,

7
02:04.190 --> 02:05.520
you'll make good money

8
02:05.980 --> 02:08.440
to cover some good medicine for your mother.

9
02:08.520 --> 02:09.669
If you lose,

10
02:10.680 --> 02:12.640
you shall behave and wait for me at home.

11
02:12.640 --> 02:13.690
I will go meet you.

12
02:26.310 --> 02:26.970
Changxuan,

13
02:28.020 --> 02:29.220
why did you let her go?

14
02:32.260 --> 02:33.790
She's merely a schoolgirl.

15
02:34.650 --> 02:36.680
Normally speaking, an experience like this

16
02:36.680 --> 02:38.400
would have scared her stiff.

17
02:40.090 --> 02:42.490
Yet she actually had the nerve to provoke me

18
02:42.870 --> 02:44.280
and bargain with me.

19
02:46.250 --> 02:47.579
Interesting people are

20
02:48.120 --> 02:49.079
rare to come by.

21
03:09.750 --> 03:11.010
By the way, Changxuan,

22
03:11.060 --> 03:12.650
I talked to Master Jin on the phone.

23
03:12.650 --> 03:13.130
He said

24
03:13.590 --> 03:14.400
those assassins

25
03:14.400 --> 03:15.210
probably sneaked in

26
03:15.210 --> 03:16.370
during our recruitment

27
03:16.370 --> 03:17.250
a month ago.

28
03:18.020 --> 03:19.620
We've lost the trail for now.

29
03:19.630 --> 03:21.829
I'll try to trace the source of the guns.

30
03:34.740 --> 03:35.410
Mrs. Zhao.

31
03:36.470 --> 03:38.340
Pingjun, you're finally back.

32
03:38.410 --> 03:39.460
Go check in on your mom.

33
03:39.460 --> 03:41.190
She's been coughing all night.

34
03:42.020 --> 03:42.630
Thank you.

35
03:42.630 --> 03:43.530
Hurry.

36
03:49.480 --> 03:51.020
Mother, Mother.

37
03:53.150 --> 03:53.970
Let me help you up.

38
03:53.970 --> 03:54.470
Come on.

39
04:11.130 --> 04:12.840
What kept you out so late?

40
04:15.430 --> 04:17.740
I went for an interview at Xiangxi Hotel today

41
04:17.740 --> 04:18.680
and did a trial shift,

42
04:18.680 --> 04:19.880
so I'm home a bit late.

43
04:23.010 --> 04:23.740
Pingjun.

44
04:27.220 --> 04:28.630
It's all my fault.

45
04:29.720 --> 04:30.500
I'm sorry

46
04:31.310 --> 04:32.570
for dragging you down.

47
04:33.040 --> 04:34.040
You haven't had

48
04:34.680 --> 04:35.830
a single easy day

49
04:36.920 --> 04:38.930
or enjoyed any happy moments

50
04:39.510 --> 04:41.040
growing up with me.

51
04:42.040 --> 04:42.659
Mother,

52
04:43.120 --> 04:44.650
what are you talking about?

53
04:45.120 --> 04:47.010
Being able to stay

54
04:47.240 --> 04:48.480
by your side

55
04:48.680 --> 04:49.940
is already a blessing.

56
04:50.300 --> 04:51.300
It takes several lifetimes

57
04:51.300 --> 04:52.500
of merit to earn this.

58
05:01.320 --> 05:04.360
[Yuchun Theater]

59
05:24.360 --> 05:25.620
Fifth Young Master Yu.

60
05:26.270 --> 05:26.750
Miss,

61
05:26.830 --> 05:28.490
Fifth Young Master Yu is here.

62
05:34.270 --> 05:34.690
Keep

63
05:34.690 --> 05:36.460
this dried tangerine peel for your lady.

64
05:36.460 --> 05:37.540
Taking some every day

65
05:37.540 --> 05:38.800
is good for her throat.

66
05:39.750 --> 05:42.750
Dried tangerine peel is said to be as pricey as gold.

67
05:43.159 --> 05:43.770
Miss,

68
05:43.770 --> 05:44.330
Fifth Young Master Yu

69
05:44.330 --> 05:45.360
brought you such a precious gift.

70
05:45.360 --> 05:46.930
He really cares about you.

71
05:50.750 --> 05:51.570
A woman's heart

72
05:51.570 --> 05:53.010
is harder than a bullet.

73
05:54.920 --> 05:56.320
Are you not worried about

74
05:57.060 --> 05:59.060
yesterday's assassination at all?

75
06:01.370 --> 06:03.890
Given your capabilities, Fifth Young Master Yu,

76
06:03.890 --> 06:05.350
you would be fine for sure.

77
06:19.070 --> 06:20.930
Did you find out who was behind it?

78
06:21.270 --> 06:21.750
People

79
06:21.750 --> 06:23.680
who want to kill me abound in Nanhuai,

80
06:23.680 --> 06:25.040
but few have the guts

81
06:25.040 --> 06:25.880
to make a move

82
06:26.810 --> 06:27.810
at Xiangxi Hotel.

83
06:28.250 --> 06:30.120
When I went to the event yesterday,

84
06:30.120 --> 06:31.130
I heard them say

85
06:32.100 --> 06:34.620
someone was interested in the land in Changping Mountain

86
06:34.620 --> 06:36.550
and was determined to purchase it.

87
06:38.420 --> 06:40.020
What did you sing yesterday?

88
06:41.360 --> 06:43.290
"The Phoenix Hairpin," of course.

89
06:47.010 --> 06:48.740
You still haven't gotten tired

90
06:49.860 --> 06:51.720
of singing it after so many years?

91
06:55.870 --> 06:56.680
Ziyi,

92
06:56.770 --> 06:57.500
Fifth Young Master Yu

93
06:57.500 --> 06:58.740
risked his own life

94
06:58.770 --> 07:00.270
to save you yesterday.

95
07:00.570 --> 07:02.480
That indicates no ordinary relationship.

96
07:02.480 --> 07:03.070
Have you two

97
07:03.070 --> 07:04.180
been hooking up for quite a while

98
07:04.180 --> 07:05.760
and kept it a secret from us?

99
07:05.990 --> 07:09.270
[Dulcet Singing]

100
07:07.510 --> 07:08.110
Come here.

101
07:10.600 --> 07:12.120
Did you see Fifth Young Master Yu?

102
07:12.120 --> 07:13.160
I think Fifth Young Master Yu

103
07:13.160 --> 07:14.760
went to Miss Lan Qing's room.

104
07:19.180 --> 07:19.980
Ziyi!

105
07:22.830 --> 07:23.500
Lan Qing.

106
07:26.190 --> 07:27.160
Actually, you don't have to sing here

107
07:27.160 --> 07:28.560
for the rest of your life.

108
07:29.270 --> 07:29.980
If you want

109
07:29.980 --> 07:31.580
to go anywhere in the future,

110
07:31.810 --> 07:33.140
I'll arrange it for you.

111
07:38.240 --> 07:39.570
I'm not going anywhere.

112
07:42.020 --> 07:43.230
I'll just stay here.

113
07:45.920 --> 07:47.980
Whenever you want to listen to a song,

114
07:49.010 --> 07:49.740
I'll be here.

115
08:04.130 --> 08:05.200
Why doesn't this pencil

116
08:05.200 --> 08:06.790
feel right in my hand today?

117
08:41.419 --> 08:42.299
Is it good?

118
08:52.250 --> 08:53.340
Satisfied now?

119
08:56.860 --> 08:58.190
I'll be waiting for you.

120
09:21.550 --> 09:22.400
Excuse me,

121
09:22.650 --> 09:23.980
did Feng Yao come today?

122
09:24.100 --> 09:24.830
She took the day off

123
09:24.830 --> 09:25.860
and didn't come to school.

124
09:25.860 --> 09:28.170
Then do you know where she lives?

125
09:29.860 --> 09:30.840
Nope.

126
09:30.940 --> 09:32.410
She transferred here last semester.

127
09:32.410 --> 09:33.740
None of us know her well.

128
09:34.410 --> 09:35.340
Seems like

129
09:35.550 --> 09:37.880
I need to go to Xiangxi Hotel to find clues.

130
09:38.120 --> 09:40.030
[List of Hires]

131
09:38.200 --> 09:39.200
Sun Mengxian goes

132
09:39.370 --> 09:40.900
to the western restaurant.

133
09:42.010 --> 09:42.940
Zhou Yanchu goes

134
09:43.270 --> 09:44.200
to the ballroom.

135
09:44.250 --> 09:46.250
Yu Lanlan goes to the housekeeping.

136
09:46.250 --> 09:47.180
Chen Yongli goes

137
09:47.390 --> 09:48.290
to the reception.

138
09:48.290 --> 09:48.890
Thank you, Master Jin.

139
09:48.890 --> 09:49.950
-Thank you, Master Jin. -Thank you, Master Jin.

140
09:49.950 --> 09:51.360
Thank you, Master Jin.

141
09:53.500 --> 09:56.050
Ye Pingjun, you are assigned to the opera hall.

142
09:56.050 --> 09:57.980
You will work in the Yuchun Troupe.

143
09:58.410 --> 09:59.890
This is Troupe Leader Qian.

144
09:59.890 --> 10:01.290
From now on, he'll be in charge

145
10:01.290 --> 10:02.750
of your work assignments.

146
10:03.410 --> 10:04.670
Thank you, Master Jin.

147
10:05.870 --> 10:06.400
This way,

148
10:06.720 --> 10:07.180
please.

149
10:07.650 --> 10:08.310
Ye Pingjun.

150
10:09.790 --> 10:11.120
I heard that last night,

151
10:11.360 --> 10:13.160
Fifth Young Master Yu let you go.

152
10:14.270 --> 10:15.000
Miss Ye,

153
10:16.750 --> 10:18.210
you're really something.

154
10:25.750 --> 10:27.200
Miss Ye, please.

155
10:36.860 --> 10:38.190
The theater is up ahead.

156
10:39.720 --> 10:40.820
Troupe Leader Qian,

157
10:40.820 --> 10:41.790
what exactly

158
10:41.860 --> 10:42.990
does my job involve?

159
10:43.620 --> 10:45.820
You will mainly copy scripts

160
10:45.860 --> 10:46.670
and

161
10:46.670 --> 10:48.960
read scripts to the most popular artist of our troupe,

162
10:48.960 --> 10:50.790
Miss Lan Qing.

163
10:52.110 --> 10:57.680
[Chunfeng Troupe]

164
10:57.790 --> 10:58.980
This is the Chunfeng Troupe

165
10:58.980 --> 10:59.820
of our hotel.

166
11:01.150 --> 11:02.810
The theater is right up there.

167
11:07.730 --> 11:08.900
["A Dream in the Garden" by Lan Qing]

168
11:14.460 --> 11:17.630
Miss Lan Qing is really good at dancing with water sleeves.

169
11:17.630 --> 11:19.500
But unfortunately, she is illiterate

170
11:19.500 --> 11:21.250
and can't read new scripts.

171
11:21.280 --> 11:23.050
She needs someone to read them

172
11:23.130 --> 11:24.820
line by line.

173
11:27.150 --> 11:31.320
-Nice! -Bravo!

174
12:15.960 --> 12:16.720
Miss Tao,

175
12:16.720 --> 12:19.450
what brings you here to listen to the opera today?

176
12:20.200 --> 12:20.960
What?

177
12:21.500 --> 12:24.010
Is this opera only for you, Fifth Young Master Yu,

178
12:24.010 --> 12:24.960
but not for me?

179
12:25.500 --> 12:27.170
Then I must thank you on behalf of Lan Qing

180
12:27.170 --> 12:29.170
for gracing her with your presence.

181
12:31.500 --> 12:32.630
My sister said

182
12:32.890 --> 12:34.220
you saved me yesterday,

183
12:34.440 --> 12:35.550
so I should

184
12:35.840 --> 12:37.250
express my gratitude.

185
12:38.100 --> 12:39.770
There's no need for formalities

186
12:39.770 --> 12:40.500
between us.

187
13:00.010 --> 13:00.670
Be careful.

188
13:00.670 --> 13:01.670
Don't wrinkle it.

189
13:05.040 --> 13:05.900
Troupe Leader.

190
13:12.130 --> 13:13.260
Troupe Leader Qian.

191
13:14.290 --> 13:14.790
Troupe Leader.

192
13:14.790 --> 13:15.650
Troupe Leader.

193
13:16.620 --> 13:19.650
-Bravo! -Nice!

194
13:20.360 --> 13:21.460
The one on stage

195
13:21.460 --> 13:22.410
is the most popular star

196
13:22.410 --> 13:23.600
of our troupe,

197
13:23.720 --> 13:24.960
Miss Lan Qing.

198
13:26.550 --> 13:27.550
So noisy!

199
13:29.530 --> 13:31.990
Like they've never watched an opera before!

200
13:35.960 --> 13:37.000
Oh, Taochun.

201
13:37.720 --> 13:38.720
Lan Qing

202
13:38.720 --> 13:40.300
is the most popular star

203
13:40.320 --> 13:41.720
of our Yuchun Troupe.

204
13:41.960 --> 13:43.200
Cheering for her

205
13:43.360 --> 13:45.320
brings honor to us.

206
13:46.220 --> 13:48.550
She hooked up with Eldest Young Master Yu before.

207
13:48.550 --> 13:50.250
But right after he died in battle,

208
13:50.250 --> 13:52.150
she just turned to follow Fifth Young Master Yu.

209
13:52.150 --> 13:53.290
She's got him crazy for her,

210
13:53.290 --> 13:54.860
keeping his "sister-in-law" as a mistress.

211
13:54.860 --> 13:56.860
How is she our troupe's top star?

212
13:56.860 --> 13:57.530
She is literally

213
13:57.530 --> 13:58.750
the top star of sex scandals!

214
13:58.750 --> 13:59.740
Oh, my goodness,

215
14:00.150 --> 14:00.970
watch your mouth!

216
14:00.970 --> 14:02.030
Do you want to die?

217
14:02.220 --> 14:04.250
How dare you gossip about Fifth Young Master Yu?

218
14:04.250 --> 14:05.700
If word gets out,

219
14:05.770 --> 14:07.290
even our troupe will...

220
14:09.720 --> 14:11.050
I didn't hear anything.

221
14:13.650 --> 14:14.790
Here's the thing.

222
14:15.340 --> 14:17.010
In our Xiangxi Hotel,

223
14:17.150 --> 14:18.360
you must remember that

224
14:18.360 --> 14:19.560
Fifth Young Master Yu

225
14:19.600 --> 14:20.740
is the last one

226
14:20.740 --> 14:22.140
you can afford to offend.

227
14:22.500 --> 14:24.010
You have no idea...

228
14:24.200 --> 14:25.390
-Bravo! -Bravo!

229
14:25.390 --> 14:26.990
Anyway, just keep it in mind.

230
14:29.480 --> 14:31.130
-Encore! -Encore!

231
14:31.580 --> 14:32.910
Encore!

232
14:34.050 --> 14:34.860
Bravo!

233
14:35.750 --> 14:37.810
These opera fans are quite generous.

234
14:51.670 --> 14:53.080
Wow, these hair ornaments!

235
14:53.080 --> 14:54.240
How lavish!

236
14:59.670 --> 15:00.170
It's so hard

237
15:00.170 --> 15:01.890
to read Fifth Young Master Yu's mind.

238
15:01.890 --> 15:03.130
Yesterday, he risked his life

239
15:03.130 --> 15:04.000
for Ziyi.

240
15:04.500 --> 15:05.670
Today, he spent a fortune

241
15:05.670 --> 15:06.670
on Lan Qing.

242
15:10.320 --> 15:12.650
She's no more than a humble opera performer.

243
15:12.650 --> 15:14.980
When men are in a good mood, they have fun with her.

244
15:14.980 --> 15:17.380
But when they're not, they just discard her

245
15:17.480 --> 15:18.680
and forget about her.

246
15:19.620 --> 15:20.340
She's just

247
15:20.340 --> 15:21.720
a plaything for men.

248
15:37.600 --> 15:38.730
Where are you going?

249
15:52.700 --> 15:54.940
Troupe Leader Qian said the contract was signed

250
15:54.940 --> 15:56.470
and asked you to take a look.

251
15:56.530 --> 15:57.260
Please go in.

252
15:58.890 --> 15:59.510
Thank you.

253
16:01.740 --> 16:07.220
[Yuchun Theater]

254
16:11.040 --> 16:11.850
Come in.

255
16:27.320 --> 16:28.250
It's you?

256
16:33.550 --> 16:34.670
So you are

257
16:34.670 --> 16:35.890
the real boss

258
16:35.890 --> 16:36.960
behind Master Jin.

259
16:37.880 --> 16:39.140
You're quick-witted.

260
16:41.360 --> 16:43.020
I don't want this job anymore.

261
16:43.390 --> 16:45.450
You've already signed the contract.

262
16:46.320 --> 16:47.450
And I've stamped it.

263
16:47.980 --> 16:49.040
It's now in effect.

264
16:50.080 --> 16:51.080
For the next year,

265
16:51.150 --> 16:51.860
you must obey

266
16:51.860 --> 16:53.260
any orders from the boss.

267
16:53.660 --> 16:55.630
[Juvenile trainee or apprentice: Ye Pingjun]

268
16:57.000 --> 16:59.000
If I had known that you were the boss,

269
16:59.000 --> 17:00.680
I wouldn't have signed it.

270
17:00.520 --> 17:03.010
[Xiangxi Hotel Employment Contract]

271
17:01.500 --> 17:03.460
One silver dollar for breach of contract, right?

272
17:03.460 --> 17:04.089
Alright,

273
17:04.700 --> 17:05.510
I'll pay it.

274
17:05.540 --> 17:05.849
[Juvenile trainee or apprentice: Ye Pingjun] [Employer: Yu Changxuan]

275
17:13.440 --> 17:16.450
[Needs to pay the employer for breach of contract: 100 silver dollars]

276
17:19.599 --> 17:21.280
[Needs to pay the employer for breach of contract: 100 silver dollars]

277
17:21.300 --> 17:24.569
[Juvenile trainee or apprentice: Ye Pingjun] [Employer: Yu Changxuan]

278
17:22.550 --> 17:23.250
Pay it,

279
17:23.900 --> 17:24.900
and we'll be even.

280
17:26.420 --> 17:28.140
You tampered with the contract arbitrarily.

281
17:28.140 --> 17:29.000
Are you any different

282
17:29.000 --> 17:29.940
from a shameless scoundrel?

283
17:29.830 --> 17:32.520
[Juvenile trainee or apprentice: Ye Pingjun] [Employer: Yu Changxuan]

284
17:30.790 --> 17:31.610
Do you really think

285
17:31.610 --> 17:33.030
law doesn't exist in Nanhuai,

286
17:33.030 --> 17:34.830
and you can do whatever you want?

287
17:34.890 --> 17:36.380
The Nanhuai High Court

288
17:36.900 --> 17:38.900
is located at Jia No. 2, East Street.

289
17:39.030 --> 17:40.090
Feel free to sue me anytime.

290
17:40.090 --> 17:42.000
However, just a kind reminder—

291
17:43.850 --> 17:44.850
our bet

292
17:45.700 --> 17:46.760
is only for 10 days.

293
17:47.510 --> 17:49.090
You're running out of time.

294
17:53.590 --> 17:54.250
Come back.

295
17:57.700 --> 17:58.500
Sit down.

296
18:15.640 --> 18:17.500
Since I hired you at a high salary,

297
18:18.940 --> 18:19.990
I must

298
18:20.740 --> 18:22.330
test you for Lan Qing.

299
18:23.220 --> 18:26.780
["Tears on a Cyan Robe"]

300
18:24.220 --> 18:25.350
Read me a paragraph.

301
18:38.090 --> 18:39.050
Mencius said,

302
18:39.770 --> 18:41.900
"A sense of shame is so important to people.

303
18:41.900 --> 18:43.740
With it, one may become a sage;

304
18:44.050 --> 18:46.350
losing it, one is no better than a beast."

305
18:46.900 --> 18:48.460
Mencius meant that

306
18:48.790 --> 18:49.640
the most important thing

307
18:49.640 --> 18:51.570
for a man is to have a sense of shame.

308
18:51.810 --> 18:53.720
Those without a sense of shame

309
18:53.900 --> 18:55.500
will only end up like beasts.

310
18:58.640 --> 19:01.040
I fired a shot at the training ground today.

311
19:02.660 --> 19:04.250
It was a fine steed,

312
19:05.590 --> 19:07.190
and I was also very fond of it.

313
19:07.660 --> 19:09.790
But unfortunately, it was untamable.

314
19:12.800 --> 19:14.730
So what was the point of keeping it?

315
19:17.380 --> 19:18.780
Everything in this world

316
19:19.090 --> 19:20.500
has its own fate.

317
19:20.810 --> 19:21.550
Some things are

318
19:21.550 --> 19:23.550
destined not to be yours to command.

319
19:23.590 --> 19:25.160
It won't listen to you

320
19:25.940 --> 19:27.340
even if you take its life.

321
19:29.000 --> 19:29.830
What a pity.

322
19:31.680 --> 19:33.660
I'm just a stubborn person.

323
19:36.700 --> 19:37.900
I was born with a bad habit

324
19:37.900 --> 19:39.510
of never taking advice.

325
19:40.810 --> 19:42.220
For a disobedient horse,

326
19:43.160 --> 19:44.900
I just shot it dead.

327
19:46.380 --> 19:47.850
For disobedient people,

328
19:48.790 --> 19:50.030
I'll pull out

329
19:51.480 --> 19:52.400
their "thorns"

330
19:54.270 --> 19:55.400
one by one.

331
20:11.790 --> 20:12.990
What brings you here?

332
20:14.140 --> 20:16.200
I thought you went somewhere for fun.

333
20:16.200 --> 20:17.290
It turns out that you're

334
20:17.290 --> 20:19.200
staring at a little girl here.

335
20:19.790 --> 20:20.640
Is it fun?

336
20:24.030 --> 20:24.940
Ye Pingjun?

337
20:27.030 --> 20:28.360
What are you doing here?

338
20:32.420 --> 20:33.980
I work at the Yuchun Troupe.

339
20:34.700 --> 20:35.830
You know each other?

340
20:37.030 --> 20:38.400
We're schoolmates

341
20:38.420 --> 20:39.750
and have met a few times.

342
20:42.030 --> 20:42.890
This is weird.

343
20:42.980 --> 20:44.110
How did you sneak in?

344
20:45.010 --> 20:46.750
Even a servant here should have

345
20:47.160 --> 20:47.790
a father or brother

346
20:47.790 --> 20:49.190
with some official rank.

347
20:49.570 --> 20:51.170
But what's your background?

348
20:51.610 --> 20:52.710
Did you

349
20:53.070 --> 20:54.630
fake your resume?

350
20:54.900 --> 20:56.430
Miss Tao, your imagination

351
20:56.460 --> 20:57.590
is wild.

352
20:59.790 --> 21:00.880
At school,

353
21:01.010 --> 21:03.470
you make money by doing homework for others.

354
21:04.090 --> 21:05.290
After school,

355
21:05.290 --> 21:07.500
you do part-time jobs everywhere.

356
21:07.520 --> 21:09.220
Yet you still haven't earned enough?

357
21:09.220 --> 21:11.830
You've even stooped to serving an opera performer.

358
21:11.830 --> 21:13.490
You really have no bottom line

359
21:14.000 --> 21:15.660
when it comes to making money.

360
21:17.200 --> 21:18.010
You're right.

361
21:18.330 --> 21:20.640
I'll do anything to make money.

362
21:21.830 --> 21:22.570
You can also come to me

363
21:22.570 --> 21:23.830
for anything you need.

364
21:23.920 --> 21:26.490
Be it doing homework, shopping, or walking dogs,

365
21:26.490 --> 21:28.820
I can do everything. The more, the better.

366
21:38.110 --> 21:39.690
Darn it! Are you blind?

367
21:41.310 --> 21:41.880
Sorry.

368
21:45.440 --> 21:47.860
Isn't this Director Liang Wenbo

369
21:48.050 --> 21:49.850
from the Chunfeng Drama Troupe?

370
21:50.110 --> 21:50.680
Sorry,

371
21:50.680 --> 21:52.080
I didn't do it on purpose.

372
21:54.980 --> 21:56.640
Excuse me. Please let me pass.

373
21:57.850 --> 21:59.290
I heard...

374
22:00.790 --> 22:02.110
Director Liang, I heard you

375
22:02.110 --> 22:03.610
just wrote a new play

376
22:04.180 --> 22:05.190
called

377
22:05.810 --> 22:07.140
"Elegant Rendezvous."

378
22:07.530 --> 22:08.160
Yes.

379
22:08.660 --> 22:09.790
It'll premiere next month.

380
22:09.790 --> 22:11.000
If you are interested,

381
22:11.000 --> 22:12.420
you are welcome to come and watch.

382
22:12.420 --> 22:14.620
The title of your play is quite strange.

383
22:15.550 --> 22:16.940
What does it mean?

384
22:19.400 --> 22:21.420
Literally, it means

385
22:22.250 --> 22:23.360
a secret rendezvous

386
22:23.360 --> 22:24.690
in an elegant demeanor.

387
22:25.590 --> 22:27.840
Rendezvous? Elegant? What does that mean?

388
22:27.840 --> 22:29.500
You'll know if you have a chance to see it.

389
22:29.500 --> 22:30.450
Excuse me.

390
22:34.420 --> 22:35.680
I only know that

391
22:35.750 --> 22:38.940
marrying a good man is the best way to secure your future.

392
22:44.530 --> 22:45.900
[Exclusively for Xiangxi Hotel]

393
22:46.330 --> 22:47.380
There's no such name

394
22:47.380 --> 22:48.640
on the interview list.

395
22:49.030 --> 22:51.090
Are you sure you remember correctly?

396
22:56.960 --> 22:59.620
So Feng Yao really didn't attend the interview.

397
23:00.420 --> 23:02.620
It seems that she is indeed suspicious.

398
23:15.590 --> 23:16.550
You're back

399
23:17.590 --> 23:19.050
from Shenyang so quickly.

400
23:19.160 --> 23:20.220
I was only away for one day,

401
23:20.220 --> 23:21.900
and something this serious happened.

402
23:21.900 --> 23:22.660
Therefore,

403
23:23.380 --> 23:24.380
only with you here

404
23:25.200 --> 23:27.730
will those underlings dare not make trouble.

405
23:30.350 --> 23:31.750
Have you found any clues?

406
23:32.720 --> 23:33.590
The old man is investigating.

407
23:33.590 --> 23:34.590
He will handle it.

408
23:56.850 --> 23:58.050
You and your brother

409
23:58.790 --> 24:00.450
share exactly the same habit.

410
24:28.050 --> 24:28.850
Jin,

411
24:30.010 --> 24:32.010
your taste in wine is getting worse.

412
24:32.750 --> 24:34.150
It tastes so astringent.

413
24:40.550 --> 24:42.480
But their tempers are as different

414
24:42.490 --> 24:43.870
as chalk and cheese.

415
24:48.500 --> 24:48.960
Father,

416
24:49.330 --> 24:50.660
this is the bullet found at the scene

417
24:50.660 --> 24:52.350
where Changxuan was assassinated.

418
24:52.350 --> 24:54.280
It's verified to be from Palm Bolt.

419
24:54.460 --> 24:55.120
Currently,

420
24:55.310 --> 24:57.640
only Mu Linsen's army is equipped with it.

421
24:58.900 --> 24:59.940
Mu Linsen.

422
25:01.740 --> 25:04.100
He was trying to sabotage

423
25:04.220 --> 25:05.680
our Yu-Chu allied forces.

424
25:06.960 --> 25:08.500
This man's been vicious,

425
25:08.900 --> 25:11.090
always playing tricks in the dark.

426
25:11.590 --> 25:13.530
The assassins were all death row inmates

427
25:13.530 --> 25:14.830
who were secretly swapped out

428
25:14.830 --> 25:16.160
and taken from death row

429
25:16.350 --> 25:18.050
one by one in a month.

430
25:20.400 --> 25:22.530
No matter how far Mu Linsen's reach is,

431
25:24.000 --> 25:27.330
he must have had someone colluding with him from the inside.

432
25:27.660 --> 25:28.750
Go back to Nanhuai

433
25:29.400 --> 25:30.860
and get to the bottom of it.

434
25:31.030 --> 25:31.640
Yes.

435
25:50.220 --> 25:51.590
Come on,

436
25:52.270 --> 25:53.570
my future in-law,

437
25:55.030 --> 25:57.050
I paid this visit today

438
25:57.330 --> 25:59.260
to specifically apologize to you.

439
26:02.770 --> 26:03.850
It was indeed my fault

440
26:03.850 --> 26:04.910
for not telling you

441
26:05.400 --> 26:07.030
the assassination plan in advance.

442
26:07.030 --> 26:09.160
But my men knew when to stop

443
26:09.610 --> 26:12.410
and would never hurt your two precious daughters.

444
26:12.830 --> 26:14.350
You caused such a commotion,

445
26:14.350 --> 26:15.280
yet Yu Changxuan

446
26:15.590 --> 26:17.150
is still alive and well, isn't he?

447
26:17.150 --> 26:18.240
The Yu family helped Chu Wenfu

448
26:18.240 --> 26:19.220
seize my turf.

449
26:19.980 --> 26:22.770
And now they want to join forces with the Chu family.

450
26:22.770 --> 26:24.830
Going after the Yu family's only heir

451
26:25.030 --> 26:26.810
is a warning to Yu Zhongquan,

452
26:27.460 --> 26:29.190
showing him my stance clearly.

453
26:29.550 --> 26:30.610
Let's see if he will

454
26:31.570 --> 26:32.940
back out of the alliance

455
26:33.680 --> 26:34.940
or insist on his folly.

456
26:36.920 --> 26:39.440
If Yu Zhongquan holds onto the alliance,

457
26:39.550 --> 26:40.950
do you have a backup plan?

458
26:41.720 --> 26:42.250
I, Mu Linsen,

459
26:42.250 --> 26:44.110
only believe in one simple truth.

460
26:45.510 --> 26:47.530
If I can't have a major force

461
26:48.010 --> 26:49.610
like the Yu family on my side,

462
26:49.980 --> 26:51.610
then no one else can.

463
26:52.460 --> 26:53.740
If Yu Zhongquan is dead-set

464
26:53.740 --> 26:54.900
on being Chu Wenfu's right-hand man

465
26:54.900 --> 26:56.100
and going against me,

466
26:57.850 --> 26:58.850
I will remove

467
26:58.850 --> 27:00.180
this thorn myself.

468
27:10.200 --> 27:10.920
Hello?

469
27:11.010 --> 27:12.000
Anybody home?

470
27:16.220 --> 27:16.960
Feng Yao.

471
27:18.700 --> 27:19.310
Feng Yao?

472
27:47.300 --> 27:48.340
Medicine dregs?

473
27:50.440 --> 27:52.500
Someone is sick in Feng Yao's family?

474
28:02.550 --> 28:05.140
Ephedra, notopterygium, poria.

475
28:07.030 --> 28:08.160
This is almost the same

476
28:08.160 --> 28:09.620
as my mom's prescription.

477
28:14.220 --> 28:15.440
So you mean this girl.

478
28:15.790 --> 28:16.720
Yeah, I know her.

479
28:16.750 --> 28:17.550
She comes here

480
28:17.550 --> 28:18.880
to get meds every month.

481
28:19.740 --> 28:20.270
Then

482
28:20.570 --> 28:21.460
when was the last time

483
28:21.460 --> 28:22.460
you saw her?

484
28:23.000 --> 28:24.290
Her father has lung disease.

485
28:24.290 --> 28:26.200
The meds he uses are very expensive.

486
28:26.200 --> 28:27.610
She's barely scraped together

487
28:27.610 --> 28:28.870
enough money for them.

488
28:28.980 --> 28:29.640
Well, then,

489
28:29.810 --> 28:30.400
do you know

490
28:30.400 --> 28:31.740
where she moved to?

491
28:31.830 --> 28:32.740
She moved?

492
28:33.980 --> 28:35.310
I honestly have no idea.

493
28:36.740 --> 28:38.960
I hope she moved to a good place.

494
28:39.960 --> 28:41.400
What do you mean?

495
28:41.790 --> 28:43.830
The little girl's lived a tough life.

496
28:43.830 --> 28:44.770
It's

497
28:45.090 --> 28:46.110
just her

498
28:46.200 --> 28:48.220
and her seriously ill father at home.

499
28:48.220 --> 28:50.220
She takes care of him all by herself.

500
28:50.440 --> 28:51.940
She is such a filial child.

501
28:52.500 --> 28:54.160
It makes me feel sorry for her.

502
28:54.460 --> 28:55.200
Tomorrow night

503
28:55.200 --> 28:57.510
happens to be when she usually comes to get meds.

504
28:57.510 --> 28:59.110
I wonder if she will come.

505
29:01.650 --> 29:04.410
[Yuchun Theater]

506
29:21.700 --> 29:22.740
Miss Lan Qing,

507
29:23.200 --> 29:24.800
I'm done copying the script.

508
29:24.810 --> 29:26.340
Let me read you a paragraph.

509
29:26.480 --> 29:27.270
Okay.

510
29:32.090 --> 29:33.680
"Beneath the moon hanging high in the sky,

511
29:33.680 --> 29:35.440
clouds drift close along the path.

512
29:35.440 --> 29:38.240
Chilled to the bone, I even dread a dream of autumn.

513
29:38.640 --> 29:41.270
What in the world runs deeper than love?

514
29:42.070 --> 29:45.180
It leaves only soul-crushing heartache."

515
29:47.510 --> 29:48.300
Miss Ye,

516
29:49.570 --> 29:50.900
although I can't read,

517
29:51.350 --> 29:52.720
I can tell that

518
29:53.170 --> 29:54.170
your handwriting

519
29:54.460 --> 29:57.390
is prettier than others'. You put your heart into it.

520
29:59.570 --> 30:00.700
Miss Lan Qing,

521
30:01.070 --> 30:02.530
I'm flattered.

522
30:05.570 --> 30:07.810
We'll be spending a lot of time together,

523
30:07.810 --> 30:09.210
so you can take it easy

524
30:09.940 --> 30:11.850
and just call me Lan Qing from now on.

525
30:11.850 --> 30:12.660
Then...

526
30:13.380 --> 30:14.770
You can call me Pingjun.

527
30:15.750 --> 30:16.440
Pingjun.

528
30:22.810 --> 30:23.750
Du Liniang

529
30:23.770 --> 30:25.460
and Liu Mengmei in this play

530
30:25.720 --> 30:27.700
may have had a brilliant love story,

531
30:27.700 --> 30:29.070
but you never know what life will bring.

532
30:29.070 --> 30:31.000
They were separated by life and death.

533
30:31.000 --> 30:31.900
This is fate.

534
30:33.010 --> 30:34.870
Women inside and outside the play

535
30:35.050 --> 30:35.740
share

536
30:36.270 --> 30:37.660
the same bitter fate.

537
30:38.220 --> 30:39.150
That's not true.

538
30:39.460 --> 30:41.110
I actually want to compose a play

539
30:41.110 --> 30:42.310
to show everyone that

540
30:42.350 --> 30:44.310
women are not just like duckweed at the mercy of fate.

541
30:44.310 --> 30:45.770
Women can also use the pen

542
30:45.770 --> 30:47.300
for their own life stories.

543
30:47.420 --> 30:48.620
Then when you finish,

544
30:48.770 --> 30:50.300
you must read it to me first.

545
30:52.900 --> 30:53.330
Deal.

546
30:57.010 --> 30:57.750
Deng Yaohui,

547
30:58.090 --> 30:58.810
your two dogs

548
30:58.810 --> 30:59.920
bit quite a few people,

549
30:59.920 --> 31:00.790
yet you still walk them to show off?

550
31:00.790 --> 31:01.810
It's just for thrills!

551
31:01.810 --> 31:03.470
I'll just pay for the damages.

552
31:07.720 --> 31:10.250
You bumped into me and didn't even apologize?

553
31:16.590 --> 31:17.400
I'm sorry.

554
31:18.310 --> 31:19.110
Ye Pingjun.

555
31:20.500 --> 31:21.440
I heard you've been

556
31:21.440 --> 31:23.300
doing odd jobs in a troupe lately.

557
31:23.660 --> 31:25.500
Didn't your family teach you

558
31:25.590 --> 31:26.500
decency

559
31:27.290 --> 31:28.420
and manners?

560
31:28.900 --> 31:30.200
Did you forget?

561
31:30.310 --> 31:31.510
She is fatherless

562
31:31.610 --> 31:32.720
and ignorant.

563
31:32.810 --> 31:35.010
How could she know decency and manners?

564
31:36.720 --> 31:37.790
People like you

565
31:37.790 --> 31:39.010
who make trouble out of nothing

566
31:39.010 --> 31:40.310
and badmouth others

567
31:40.830 --> 31:42.380
are the truly ignorant ones.

568
31:42.380 --> 31:43.640
How dare you insult me?

569
31:43.700 --> 31:44.850
Do Second Young Lady Tao and the others

570
31:44.850 --> 31:46.850
hold any grudge against Ye Pingjun?

571
31:47.420 --> 31:48.820
You're pretty eloquent.

572
31:49.350 --> 31:50.290
Can you sing?

573
31:50.500 --> 31:50.960
Come on.

574
31:53.380 --> 31:54.710
Sit here and sing for me.

575
31:54.750 --> 31:55.550
Sing one song,

576
31:55.980 --> 31:57.510
and I'll reward you with 10 silver dollars.

577
31:57.510 --> 31:59.040
How does that song go again?

578
32:00.090 --> 32:01.400
♪ Oh, dear ♪

579
32:01.400 --> 32:05.160
♪ You are my beloved sweetheart ♪

580
32:05.160 --> 32:08.790
♪ Why are you always so cold to me? ♪

581
32:11.900 --> 32:13.350
You don't want to make such easy money?

582
32:13.350 --> 32:15.410
I'll give you 10 more silver dollars.

583
32:16.550 --> 32:17.410
Don't touch me!

584
32:36.480 --> 32:38.010
You hurt Young Master Deng.

585
32:38.310 --> 32:39.440
But Young Master Deng

586
32:39.440 --> 32:41.440
is a gentleman who's nice to ladies.

587
32:41.480 --> 32:42.510
If you kneel down

588
32:42.770 --> 32:44.100
and kowtow to him 3 times

589
32:44.270 --> 32:46.000
nicely and loudly,

590
32:46.660 --> 32:48.330
he might just let you go.

591
32:49.510 --> 32:50.520
-Yeah. -Just kowtow loudly.

592
32:50.520 --> 32:51.030
Do it!

593
32:51.030 --> 32:51.660
We're all waiting.

594
32:51.660 --> 32:53.090
He got handsy first.

595
32:54.660 --> 32:55.990
Why should I apologize?

596
32:58.110 --> 32:59.350
You've got some nerve.

597
32:59.350 --> 33:00.410
You asked for this.

598
33:02.350 --> 33:03.750
Bring the dogs over here!

599
33:05.570 --> 33:06.500
Bring them over!

600
33:13.200 --> 33:14.180
Scared?

601
33:14.850 --> 33:15.910
You're done for.

602
33:16.000 --> 33:17.250
Don't do anything crazy.

603
33:17.250 --> 33:18.560
Now you're scared?

604
33:18.610 --> 33:20.270
These two dogs are really fierce.

605
33:20.270 --> 33:21.830
They've already hurt quite a few people.

606
33:21.830 --> 33:22.480
Listen,

607
33:22.900 --> 33:24.230
with your small figure,

608
33:24.440 --> 33:26.700
you wouldn't even be a mouthful for them.

609
33:30.550 --> 33:31.750
I'll count to 10.

610
33:32.140 --> 33:33.540
If you still don't kneel,

611
33:34.460 --> 33:35.660
we'll let them loose.

612
33:35.920 --> 33:36.610
Kneel.

613
33:36.720 --> 33:37.310
Kneel!

614
33:39.530 --> 33:40.570
One.

615
33:45.030 --> 33:46.640
Two.

616
33:48.940 --> 33:49.740
Changxuan,

617
33:50.160 --> 33:52.290
it'll be a mess if she really gets hurt.

618
33:53.460 --> 33:54.460
I'd like to see

619
33:55.610 --> 33:57.500
how long she can keep being obstinate.

620
33:57.500 --> 33:58.790
Three.

621
34:01.290 --> 34:02.050
Miss.

622
34:02.290 --> 34:03.090
Miss!

623
34:03.830 --> 34:05.000
Miss, there's trouble!

624
34:05.000 --> 34:06.350
Young Master Deng and Young Master Yu

625
34:06.350 --> 34:07.850
are bullying Miss Ye

626
34:07.850 --> 34:09.460
with two giant wolfhounds!

627
34:10.260 --> 34:11.120
Where are they?

628
34:11.800 --> 34:13.400
Are you going to kneel or not?

629
34:17.210 --> 34:18.090
Kneel down!

630
34:18.210 --> 34:19.150
Kneel!

631
34:19.300 --> 34:20.190
Kneel!

632
34:20.480 --> 34:21.980
Just kneel!

633
34:24.010 --> 34:26.340
You're throwing your weight around here,

634
34:27.010 --> 34:29.540
simply riding on your ancestors' coattails.

635
34:29.820 --> 34:31.550
Without your fathers' titles,

636
34:32.190 --> 34:33.400
what do you have left?

637
34:34.400 --> 34:36.530
You want me to kneel to people like you?

638
34:36.590 --> 34:37.590
Honestly,

639
34:38.820 --> 34:40.020
you don't deserve it.

640
34:41.810 --> 34:42.920
Release the dogs now!

641
34:42.920 --> 34:43.590
Bite her!

642
34:44.550 --> 34:45.350
Yes, bite her!

643
34:45.420 --> 34:45.949
Bite her!

644
34:46.800 --> 34:47.330
Bite her!

645
34:47.360 --> 34:47.889
Bite her!

646
34:48.389 --> 34:48.920
Bite her!

647
34:48.929 --> 34:49.460
Bite her!

648
34:53.130 --> 34:53.820
Let's see if you

649
34:53.820 --> 34:55.420
still dare to run your mouth.

650
35:08.800 --> 35:09.510
Xinxin!

651
35:09.820 --> 35:10.590
Xinxin!

652
35:11.320 --> 35:11.760
Who?

653
35:11.880 --> 35:12.880
Who fired the gun?

654
35:21.030 --> 35:22.290
Fifth Young Master Yu?

655
35:22.300 --> 35:23.420
What are you doing?

656
35:27.780 --> 35:28.610
Why is Fifth Young Master Yu

657
35:28.610 --> 35:30.010
protecting her

658
35:30.460 --> 35:31.550
in front of everyone?

659
35:31.550 --> 35:32.590
Fifth Young Master Yu,

660
35:32.590 --> 35:33.610
this mere waitress

661
35:33.610 --> 35:34.400
is so arrogant.

662
35:34.400 --> 35:34.880
Pingjun.

663
35:34.880 --> 35:36.140
She's the one to blame!

664
35:37.570 --> 35:38.260
Fifth Young Master,

665
35:38.260 --> 35:39.860
Pingjun is my copyist.

666
35:40.190 --> 35:41.320
She is still so young.

667
35:41.320 --> 35:42.110
If she did anything

668
35:42.110 --> 35:43.650
offending these young masters,

669
35:43.650 --> 35:45.150
could you please do me a favor

670
35:45.150 --> 35:46.750
and let her go just this once?

671
35:47.300 --> 35:48.430
If someone dies here

672
35:49.230 --> 35:50.430
and ruins this place,

673
35:50.940 --> 35:52.800
how can they keep doing business?

674
35:55.650 --> 35:56.320
Ziyi!

675
36:07.420 --> 36:08.420
Take the dog away.

676
36:08.460 --> 36:08.880
Yes.

677
36:11.510 --> 36:12.440
Are you alright?

678
36:14.460 --> 36:15.040
Lan Qing,

679
36:15.860 --> 36:17.800
It's windy outside. Don't catch a cold.

680
36:17.800 --> 36:19.130
Go back inside quickly.

681
36:19.190 --> 36:19.710
Okay.

682
36:23.650 --> 36:24.400
Miss Ye.

683
36:25.860 --> 36:27.060
Do your job properly.

684
36:27.500 --> 36:28.760
If there is a next time,

685
36:29.400 --> 36:31.130
you probably won't be so lucky.

686
36:35.320 --> 36:35.880
Let's go.

687
36:39.610 --> 36:40.230
Fifth Young Master Yu's

688
36:40.230 --> 36:41.830
acting a bit weird, isn't he?

689
36:42.650 --> 36:44.050
Listen to me!

690
36:45.360 --> 36:46.050
Look,

691
36:46.460 --> 36:48.090
Fifth Young Master Yu let her out

692
36:48.090 --> 36:48.820
and even killed

693
36:48.820 --> 36:49.690
Deng Yaohui's precious dog

694
36:49.690 --> 36:51.050
for her.

695
36:52.500 --> 36:53.090
He's not the type

696
36:53.090 --> 36:54.690
to show tenderness to women.

697
36:57.000 --> 36:57.920
I got it.

698
36:59.150 --> 37:00.150
Could it be that

699
37:01.010 --> 37:01.920
Fifth Young Master Yu

700
37:01.920 --> 37:03.580
simply doesn't like that dog?

701
37:04.800 --> 37:06.600
That doesn't seem right either.

702
37:06.920 --> 37:08.150
Be honest with me,

703
37:08.150 --> 37:08.420
is it...

704
37:08.420 --> 37:10.550
Is it your place to guess his thoughts?

705
37:13.320 --> 37:14.360
I should have asked

706
37:14.360 --> 37:15.620
someone else, not you.

707
37:15.670 --> 37:16.300
You...

708
37:17.590 --> 37:19.190
It was pointless asking him.

709
37:23.550 --> 37:24.960
The Commander has told Changxuan

710
37:24.960 --> 37:27.130
again and again to lay low.

711
37:27.260 --> 37:28.130
But look at him,

712
37:28.130 --> 37:30.390
turning a deaf ear to his father's words.

713
37:30.460 --> 37:31.580
He got involved

714
37:31.920 --> 37:33.730
in an assassination the other day.

715
37:33.730 --> 37:34.730
And now,

716
37:35.050 --> 37:36.760
he runs out every day.

717
37:36.870 --> 37:37.550
Mom,

718
37:38.050 --> 37:39.400
I've heard that

719
37:39.500 --> 37:41.360
Changxuan and Second Young Lady Tao

720
37:41.360 --> 37:42.860
have grown quite close lately.

721
37:42.860 --> 37:43.730
He

722
37:43.730 --> 37:46.050
and Daiti were childhood sweethearts.

723
37:46.150 --> 37:47.130
But ever since Daiti

724
37:47.130 --> 37:48.340
went to America,

725
37:48.420 --> 37:49.780
the girls around Changxuan

726
37:49.780 --> 37:51.760
have been changing like a revolving door.

727
37:51.760 --> 37:52.420
You know what?

728
37:52.420 --> 37:54.690
I actually quite like Daiti.

729
37:56.550 --> 37:57.870
If she were here,

730
37:58.150 --> 38:00.210
maybe Changxuan would listen to her.

731
38:00.820 --> 38:02.130
This cousin of mine

732
38:02.260 --> 38:02.960
is indeed

733
38:02.960 --> 38:04.300
very outstanding.

734
38:04.730 --> 38:07.050
She graduated from a top women's college in America.

735
38:07.050 --> 38:08.110
And my uncle

736
38:08.110 --> 38:10.050
is a pastor of the Methodist Episcopal Church,

737
38:10.050 --> 38:11.450
who is highly respected.

738
38:11.500 --> 38:12.230
He's attached

739
38:12.230 --> 38:14.300
great importance to her education since she was little.

740
38:14.300 --> 38:15.440
My cousin

741
38:15.530 --> 38:16.590
is certainly

742
38:16.590 --> 38:17.650
no ordinary woman.

743
38:18.300 --> 38:20.730
If Daiti really becomes my fifth sister-in-law,

744
38:20.730 --> 38:21.650
I'm afraid our family

745
38:21.650 --> 38:23.910
will have to worship two different gods.

746
38:24.150 --> 38:25.860
What do you mean by "two different gods," Jinxuan?

747
38:25.860 --> 38:27.000
Isn't that obvious?

748
38:27.260 --> 38:29.900
Mother is a Buddhist, and Daiti is a Christian.

749
38:29.920 --> 38:30.960
Wouldn't our family

750
38:30.960 --> 38:32.690
have to worship both Guanyin

751
38:32.690 --> 38:34.110
and Jesus?

752
38:34.360 --> 38:36.150
I just wonder if these two gods

753
38:36.150 --> 38:37.230
will clash.

754
38:38.940 --> 38:40.000
Jinxuan, you've thought

755
38:40.000 --> 38:41.550
of every detail.

756
38:43.340 --> 38:44.470
This is impressive.

757
38:49.860 --> 38:51.030
As for Second Young Lady Tao,

758
38:51.030 --> 38:53.690
her father is in charge of the financial sector,

759
38:53.780 --> 38:55.280
with a bright future.

760
38:55.860 --> 38:58.190
These girls are both quite good.

761
38:58.360 --> 39:00.090
As long as Changxuan is happy,

762
39:00.460 --> 39:02.460
I will agree to whoever he likes.

763
39:04.440 --> 39:06.120
It's just that you never know how fate

764
39:06.120 --> 39:07.230
will unfold.

765
39:07.340 --> 39:09.260
But anyone who can marry into the Yu family

766
39:09.260 --> 39:10.400
is lucky.

767
39:13.860 --> 39:15.400
Is this what you want?

768
39:18.090 --> 39:19.420
Thank you, First Madam.

769
39:30.960 --> 39:32.720
[Treat men and women of all ages in internal and external medicine]

770
39:43.130 --> 39:43.940
Miss,

771
39:44.630 --> 39:46.100
I'm closing soon.

772
39:46.760 --> 39:48.160
That girl might not come.

773
39:48.630 --> 39:49.960
What are you going to do?

774
39:50.710 --> 39:51.210
Sir,

775
39:51.530 --> 39:52.660
I'll buy these meds.

776
39:56.890 --> 40:06.100
[Treat men and women of all ages in internal and external medicine]

777
40:12.400 --> 40:13.010
Freeze.

778
40:14.880 --> 40:15.610
Don't worry,

779
40:16.510 --> 40:17.370
I won't scream.

780
40:24.070 --> 40:25.000
Don't follow me.

781
40:26.030 --> 40:26.660
Feng Yao.

782
40:34.210 --> 40:34.650
I don't know

783
40:34.650 --> 40:36.070
how you found this out,

784
40:38.260 --> 40:40.040
but you'd better stay out of it.

785
40:40.460 --> 40:42.190
Just pretend you didn't see me.

786
40:42.460 --> 40:44.300
You knew the consequences

787
40:44.300 --> 40:46.100
of assassinating Yu Changxuan.

788
40:46.710 --> 40:48.910
We've had no grudge against each other.

789
40:50.570 --> 40:52.430
Why did you make me the scapegoat?

790
40:56.500 --> 40:58.760
I have no idea what you're talking about.

791
40:59.260 --> 41:01.390
You were there during the application

792
41:01.510 --> 41:03.360
but gone during the interview.

793
41:03.740 --> 41:04.670
Where did you go?

794
41:06.420 --> 41:07.710
They looked down on me

795
41:08.260 --> 41:10.210
and didn't even let me attend the interview.

796
41:10.210 --> 41:11.810
What about the fountain pen?

797
41:12.280 --> 41:13.610
How do you explain that?

798
41:14.070 --> 41:15.650
There are so many identical fountain pens.

799
41:15.650 --> 41:17.250
How can you be sure it's mine?

800
41:17.860 --> 41:18.510
If you really

801
41:18.510 --> 41:19.670
didn't frame me,

802
41:20.650 --> 41:22.310
wouldn't your first question

803
41:22.550 --> 41:23.480
have been,

804
41:23.480 --> 41:24.760
"What fountain pen?"

805
41:42.920 --> 41:43.610
That day,

806
41:45.030 --> 41:46.360
I didn't know it was you.

807
41:47.530 --> 41:48.090
I planned

808
41:48.090 --> 41:49.690
to just pin it on a random guy.

809
41:50.110 --> 41:50.760
The servants there

810
41:50.760 --> 41:52.560
all have some good backgrounds.

811
41:52.880 --> 41:54.550
Although they might suffer a bit,

812
41:54.550 --> 41:55.300
their families

813
41:55.300 --> 41:56.670
would bail them out.

814
41:57.440 --> 41:58.840
It was just a coincidence

815
41:59.010 --> 42:00.140
that I passed by you.

816
42:01.130 --> 42:02.380
But you were risking your life,

817
42:02.380 --> 42:03.420
assassinating Yu Changxuan.

818
42:03.420 --> 42:04.730
Why did you do that?

819
42:12.230 --> 42:13.610
My family of five

820
42:14.960 --> 42:17.010
was all killed by Yu Changxuan.

821
42:18.530 --> 42:20.530
So even if it costs me my life,

822
42:22.420 --> 42:24.710
I will make him pay for it with his life.

823
42:30.000 --> 42:30.610
Run!

824
42:30.980 --> 42:31.930
I'll stall them.

825
42:32.010 --> 42:32.800
Go!

826
42:33.010 --> 42:33.820
Go ahead!

827
42:59.070 --> 43:00.330
Fifth Young Master Yu.

828
43:01.570 --> 43:02.900
What are you doing here?

829
43:06.070 --> 43:07.800
I came to get meds for my mother.

830
43:10.010 --> 43:11.070
Where are the meds?

831
43:16.280 --> 43:17.940
I was just about to fetch them.

832
43:21.840 --> 43:22.420
Didn't you just

833
43:22.420 --> 43:24.880
get some for your mother a couple of days ago?

834
43:26.380 --> 43:27.510
Why do you need more?

835
43:36.530 --> 43:37.340
Besides...

836
43:38.820 --> 43:39.730
isn't there a pharmacy

837
43:39.730 --> 43:41.990
at the entrance of the alley to your home?

838
43:42.650 --> 43:44.510
Why bother going all the way here?

839
43:49.630 --> 43:50.360
I came out

840
43:51.460 --> 43:53.320
to buy yunpian pastries for my mom

841
43:53.880 --> 43:55.740
and thought I'd get the meds, too.

842
44:11.000 --> 44:12.440
Yes! It was her!

843
44:12.780 --> 44:13.760
She came to me

844
44:13.780 --> 44:15.230
to identify a girl.

845
44:15.390 --> 44:16.210
That was her.
